      "120.65",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "K1 COIL INTERFACE\nPin 1: K1_COIL_P\nPin 2: GND\nK1 part / coil clamp / polarity: TBD\nClamp shall be placed at K1 coil"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "uuid": "58c7500e-a4ed-476d-a5af-bfef6bde7eec",
    "at": [
      "224.79",
      "31.75",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "K1 MAIN CONTACT INTERFACE\nPin 1: VBAT_PROTECTED\nPin 2: MOTOR_VBAT_SAFE\nExternal K1 main NO contact only\nHigh-current / off-perfboard\nPart / rating / connector: TBD"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "uuid": "8677b3b2-f9e1-47c1-94e1-39d3be4cec72",
    "at": [
      "197.866",
      "158.242",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "S0-B SENSE\n5V/contact closed -> opto ON -> PC7 LOW\npressed/open/5V loss -> PC7 HIGH\nCandidate: VO617A-3\nValue/footprint/purchase: HOLD"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "uuid": "b971b7dc-ced4-43fe-bda6-ca3afb8fab93",
    "at": [
      "126.746",
      "127.254",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "K2 CONTROL RELAY\nCandidate: Panasonic TX2-12V\nA1/A2: coil\n11-14: HOLD NO\n21-24: K1 ENABLE NO\n12/22: NC unused\nFootprint / purchase: HOLD"
  },
  {
    "kind": "text_box",
    "uuid": "d9df0344-ac86-4be9-be59-1adfbd2b2df3",
    "at": [
      "31.75",
      "109.22",
      "0"
    ],
    "text": "DESIGN STATUS\n\nBENCH-VALIDATED\n- Battery -> fuse -> switch power path\n- MDD10A PWM/DIR static routing\n- MDD10A DIR/PWM 10k pull-downs; reset capture PASS\n- Dual encoder conditioning and hand-count\n- STM32 <-> ESP32 UART, 115200 8N1\n\nTBD / CANDIDATE\n- RevB permanent wiring continuity\n- Board power / USB backfeed policy\n- Physical E-stop K1/K2/S0/S2 implementation\n- Final F1/K1/main-wire rating\n- Vehicle left/right powered channel assignment\n- BNO085 power and I2C wiring"
  },
